{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/banner3.1.jpg?t=1745397771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Four mysterious women, one enigmatic invitation. A grand castle becomes the stage for a deadly game\u2014a mix of <strong>Russian Roulette and identity deception</strong>. Lies, death, and strategy rule the table. With a revolver in hand, use cunning tools, every bullet could be your last. Are you ready for the ultimate <strong>first-person multiplayer online</strong> experience?]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/Gif_ItemsConsume.gif?t=1745397771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udf19 </strong>\u201cNight phase begins. Close your eyes\u201c \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 <strong>Classic gameplay innovation</strong> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/core_rule.png?t=1745397771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2bBasic rules: Four players participate in Russian roulette, and each pull of the trigger is a 50% chance of survival \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/role_skill.png?t=1745397771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0Prop matching: Unique prop mechanism, which can affect the entire battle at any time \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0fParadox victory: Heretic will win immediately after ending themselves \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2605 <strong>Deadly reasoning link</strong> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/roulette_rules.png?t=1745397771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0cFirst night prophecy: Please close your eyes when it gets dark-all players get an identity verification opportunity \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/item_guide.png?t=1745397771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Game Features]</strong> \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 Each round is a 15-20 minute high-intensity psychological game \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25b6 Supports 4-player online confrontation, and each round randomly obtains a unique identity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 Special execution animations that make people feeling hot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> [Character Introduction] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc67[Saori] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/JK.png?t=1745397771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> She looks innocent and a good girl in the eyes of people around her. No one would have thought of her true identity - a vampire! Or rather, everyone who knew this secret disappeared quietly. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udc6e\u200d\u2640\ufe0f[Vela Kolt] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/\u5973\u8b66.png?t=1745397771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Everyone thinks that this policewoman is too strong, but they don't know that she has a masochistic habit in private. Her true identity is a wolf hidden among humans. When she is emotional, her ears and tail will be exposed. \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udea1[Nicky] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/\u5973\u4ec6.png?t=1745397771\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The traces of stitches on her face make it hard to imagine what she has been through. Her empty words and mechanical movements make people feel a little cold when talking to her. \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26ea\ufe0f[Isabelle] \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/extras/\u516b\u5c3a\u5927\u4eba.png?t=1745397771\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tall nun. According to rumors, no man can stare at her for three seconds. Because men who see her can't move but boner... She always wears a top hat on weekdays, making it difficult to see her expression. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>[Developer Warning] \u00a0 \u26a0\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game may cause: \u2713Permanent damage to trust between friends</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461580?t=1745397771","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461580?t=1745397771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461580/b40e7dcc0322ab04ac21d015a1ae5608c9cd20e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745397771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets